{"t":"RKLB","made":"2026-11-12 00:07","name":"Rocket Lab Corporation","ko":"로켓랩","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","employees":2600,"hq":"Long Beach, CA, United States","website":"https://rocketlabcorp.com","summary_en":"Rocket Lab Corporation, a space company, provides launch services and space systems solutions in the United States, Canada, Japan, and internationally. The company operates through launch services and space systems segments. The company provides launch services, spacecraft design services, spacecraft components, spacecraft manufacturing, optical systems, and other spacecraft and on-orbit management solutions and constellation management services, as well as designs and manufactures small and medium-class rockets and develops flight and ground software. It also designs, manufactures, and sells Electron, an orbital small launch vehicle for small spacecraft launch services, as well as develops Neutron launch vehicles for large constellation deployments, interplanetary missions, and potentially for human spaceflight. In addition, the company designs and manufactures a range of components and subsystems for its launch vehicles and spacecraft. It serves commercial, aerospace prime contractors, and government customers. Rocket Lab Corporation was formerly known as Rocket Lab USA, Inc. and changed its name to Rocket Lab Corporation in August 2021. The company was founded in 2006 and is headquartered in Long Beach, California.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"우주 회사인 Rocket Lab Corporation은 미국, 캐나다, 일본 및 전 세계에 발사 서비스와 우주 시스템 솔루션을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 발사 서비스 및 우주 시스템 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 발사 서비스, 우주선 설계 서비스, 우주선 부품, 우주선 제조, 광학 시스템, 기타 우주선 및 궤도 상 관리 솔루션과 별자리 관리 서비스를 제공할 뿐만 아니라 중소형 로켓을 설계 및 제조하고 비행 및 지상 소프트웨어를 개발합니다. 또한 소형 우주선 발사 서비스를 위한 궤도 소형 발사체인 Electron을 설계, 제조 및 판매할 뿐만 아니라 대규모 별자리 배치, 행성 간 임무 및 잠재적으로 인간 우주 비행을 위한 중성자 발사체를 개발합니다. 또한 이 회사는 발사체와 우주선을 위한 다양한 구성 요소와 하위 시스템을 설계하고 제조합니다. 상업, 항공우주 주 계약업체 및 정부 고객에게 서비스를 제공합니다. Rocket Lab Corporation은 이전에 Rocket Lab USA, Inc.로 알려졌으며 2021년 8월에 Rocket Lab Corporation으로 이름을 변경했습니다. 이 회사는 2006년에 설립되었으며 캘리포니아주 롱비치에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":66.24,"mcap":44577673216.0,"pe":null,"fpe":2338.983,"peg":null,"ps":50.54731,"pb":7.296761,"ev_ebitda":-204.424,"div":0.0,"beta":3.176,"hi52":151.0,"lo52":37.57},"fin":{"rev":881900032.0,"rev_g":0.727,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.36214,"op":-0.27635,"net":-0.25726,"roe":-0.06406,"fcf":-221815376.0,"cash":4607954944.0,"debt":120284000.0,"de":2.073,"eps":-0.37,"feps":0.02832},"own":{"short":0.073,"inst":0.59568,"insider":0.0075199995},"analyst":{"n":20,"mean":98.25,"median":100.0,"high":150.0,"low":58.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.59091,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":5,"buy":13,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":5,"buy":13,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":4,"buy":12,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":3,"buy":11,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-11","Firm":"Needham","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":100.0,"priorPriceTarget":120.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-10","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":82.0,"priorPriceTarget":85.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-10","Firm":"Keybanc","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"reit","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":100.0,"priorPriceTarget":100.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-10","Firm":"BTIG","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"reit","priceTargetAction":"","currentPriceTarget":0.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-10","Firm":"Piper Sandler","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":58.0,"priorPriceTarget":83.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-10","Firm":"Cantor Fitzgerald","ToGrade":